This directory is an Eclipse p2 update site for distributing the jSMTLIB
Eclipse plugin.

Contents:
  features/    -- Feature JAR (org.smtlib.SMTFeature_<ver>.jar)
  plugins/     -- Plugin JARs (org.smtlib.SMT_<ver>.jar, org.smtlib.plugin.SMTPlugin_<ver>.jar)
  site.xml     -- p2 site manifest (current version)
  category.xml -- p2 category definition (used by PDE build; version=0.0.0 = always latest)
  artifacts.jar, content.jar -- p2 repository metadata (generated)

The features/ and plugins/ JARs and the metadata JARs are generated by
Eclipse PDE (Build > Build All on this project). They are listed in .gitignore
and must NOT be committed to git — this directory is a local build and staging
area only.

To build:
  1. In Eclipse, right-click SMTUpdateSite > Build All  (or use PDE export wizard)
  2. The site.xml version entry should match the current SMTFeature version.

To publish:
  Copy the generated artifacts.jar, content.jar, features/, and plugins/
  to the desired hosting location.
